{
  "name": "00 · Setup : HubSpot properties, demo customers, Aircall tags",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a74bd22c-ff4a-8b13-5296-f513b9fd2259",
      "name": "Run Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "b0d6e944-5f26-7f96-f494-992c7a692b31",
      "name": "Define Contact Properties",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Custom HubSpot contact properties used by the main workflow.\n// Safe to run repeatedly: \"already exists\" (409) responses are reported, not failed.\nconst props = [\n  {\n    name: 'aircall_churn_risk',\n    label: 'Aircall churn risk',\n    type: 'enumeration',\n    fieldType: 'select',\n    groupName: 'contactinformation',\n    description: 'Set by the Aircall AI call-intelligence workflow',\n    options: ['none', 'low', 'medium', 'high'].map((v, i) => ({ label: v[0].toUpperCase() + v.slice(1), value: v, displayOrder: i })),\n  },\n  { name: 'aircall_last_intent', label: 'Aircall last call intent', type: 'string', fieldType: 'text', groupName: 'contactinformation' },\n  { name: 'aircall_last_call_id', label: 'Aircall last call ID', type: 'string', fieldType: 'text', groupName: 'contactinformation' },\n];\nreturn props.map((p) => ({ json: p }));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f0d2ddc6-2181-cbf9-fc4a-29c67b17df16",
      "name": "HubSpot: Create Property",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/properties/contacts",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "hubspotAppToken",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "809b754a-8c63-175c-4d91-349ed1c09e2f",
      "name": "Define Demo Customers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Seeds the two EXISTING customers used by the support and cancellation demo scenarios.\n// (The sales/review/injection callers are intentionally unknown → contact gets created.)\nconst customers = [\n  {\n    company: { name: 'Brightline Logistics', domain: 'brightline-logistics.example' },\n    contact: { firstname: 'Tom', lastname: 'Nguyen', email: 'tom.nguyen@brightline-logistics.example', phone: '+61400333444', jobtitle: 'IT Manager', company: 'Brightline Logistics', lifecyclestage: 'customer' },\n  },\n  {\n    company: { name: 'Harbour Dental Group', domain: 'harbourdental.example' },\n    contact: { firstname: 'Priya', lastname: 'Shah', email: 'priya.shah@harbourdental.example', phone: '+61400555666', jobtitle: 'Operations Director', company: 'Harbour Dental Group', lifecyclestage: 'customer' },\n  },\n];\nreturn customers.map((c) => ({ json: c }));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "902c5b5d-6ddb-0d32-d179-fd9c30ef9039",
      "name": "HubSpot: Create Contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/contacts",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "hubspotAppToken",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ properties: $json.contact }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "10dd1e4c-d8a2-8a44-e258-83a937ab7d5f",
      "name": "Contact Created?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "82e51e2a-3eeb-e1fd-0a87-278c64afd1ea",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode === 201 }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "409 = already seeded → skip",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "id": "402473d8-bdc4-bd45-9568-86f9381b4b42",
      "name": "HubSpot: Create Company",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/companies",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "hubspotAppToken",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  properties: $('Define Demo Customers').item.json.company,\n  associations: [{ to: { id: $json.body.id }, types: [{ associationCategory: 'HUBSPOT_DEFINED', associationTypeId: 280 }] }]\n}) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3f606369-91c8-8223-45c2-69ae439e5c41",
      "name": "Define Aircall Tags",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Aircall tags the main workflow writes back. After running, copy each returned\n// tag ID into Config → aircall_tag_ids.\nconst tags = [\n  { name: 'AI-QUALIFIED-LEAD', color: '#00B388' },\n  { name: 'AI-SUPPORT-ISSUE', color: '#2A7FFF' },\n  { name: 'AI-CHURN-RISK', color: '#E5484D' },\n  { name: 'AI-NEEDS-REVIEW', color: '#F5A524' },\n  { name: 'AI-PROCESSED', color: '#8E8E93' },\n];\nreturn tags.map((t) => ({ json: t }));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "67655094-c1b2-66ca-9f5d-76ad03f1c876",
      "name": "Aircall: Create Tag",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.aircall.io/v1/tags",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBasicAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "disabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "3b728139-21ad-52fc-fcdb-d15287d3a4fb",
      "name": "Sticky · About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## One-time setup : run once, then use 01\n1. **HubSpot properties** used by the workflow (`aircall_churn_risk`, `aircall_last_intent`, `aircall_last_call_id`).\n2. **Demo customers** for the support + cancellation scenarios (existing customers).\n3. **Aircall tags** *(disabled : enable once you have Aircall API credentials, then copy tag IDs into Config)*.\n\nSafe to re-run: existing records return 409.",
        "width": 1180,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 5
      }
    }
  ],
